      "topic": "2.9 Ramps, Pulleys, Multi-Body Systems",
      "stem": "Two masses, 10 kg and 6.0 kg, hang from opposite ends of a rope over a frictionless, massless pulley (an Atwood machine). Find the acceleration of the system.",
