            "Solve for T²: T² = (4π²/GM) r³, so T = 2π√(r³/GM).",
            "This has the form y = (slope)x with y = T² and x = r³. Graph T² on the vertical axis against r³ on the horizontal axis: the result is a straight line through the origin.",
