            "Shape of the last segment: a curve, not a straight line. It leaves t = 3.0 s with a horizontal tangent (slope 0, because the force starts at 0) and bends downward, getting steeper and steeper, until its slope is −0.60 kg·m/s per second at t = 5.0 s (concave down, like the right half of an upside-down parabola). It stays above the t-axis.",
