            "Trial 2: momentum conservation, 0.40 = (0.050)(−2.0) + (0.45)v_cart, so 0.45 v_cart = 0.40 + 0.10 = 0.50 and v_cart ≈ 1.1 m/s (1.11 m/s) in the positive direction."
