            "Split for rolling: v = ωR, so K_rot = ½Iω² = ½(kMR²)(v/R)² = k(½Mv²) = k·K_trans, where I = kMR².",
            "Disk (k = ½): K_rot = ½K_trans, so K_trans = 4 units and K_rot = 2 units.",
            "Hoop (k = 1): K_rot = K_trans, so K_trans = 3 units and K_rot = 3 units.",
