            "Neither depends on M or R. For comparison, an object sliding without friction would reach √(2gh) = 4.2 m/s.",
            "Matching height: the hoop needs √(gh') = √(4gh/3), so h' = 4h/3 = 4(0.90 m)/3 = 1.2 m. The hoop must start 0.30 m higher, because a larger share of its energy goes into rotation."
