            "Because the forces are constant, the acceleration is constant. Starting from rest, d = ½at², so the average speed is d/t and the final speed is v = 2d/t.",
            "Energy for the yo-yo-Earth system (the string's tension acts where the string leaves the axle; the top of the string is held still and the string does not stretch, so that point of the yo-yo is momentarily at rest and the tension does no work): mgd = ½mv² + ½Iω².",
